{"vid":"FruPCN66t1M","source":"FruPCN66t1M.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":16.8,"txt":"I'm Sydney Bray. I am a welding student"},{"t":19.3,"txt":"at Linus Welding and Training. I came"},{"t":21.7,"txt":"here for the 12-week combination course,"},{"t":23.5,"txt":"which gets a little bit of pipe welding,"},{"t":25.8,"txt":"aluminum structural, and then a little"},{"t":27.2,"txt":"bit of MIG welding as well. I discovered"},{"t":29.3,"txt":"welding uh in high school, actually. I"},{"t":31.8,"txt":"was a sophomore, and my counselor came"},{"t":33.8,"txt":"to me and said, \"Oh, you need another"},{"t":36.8,"txt":"um course.\" So, she gave me a bunch of"},{"t":39,"txt":"options, and I'm like, \"Oh, I've never"},{"t":40.7,"txt":"thought about welding before, so"},{"t":43.2,"txt":"I thought why not?\" So, I got into it,"},{"t":45.2,"txt":"enjoyed it, did it again my junior year,"},{"t":47.5,"txt":"and then senior year. So."},{"t":53.9,"txt":"Um so, I came here. I'm already like a"},{"t":56.5,"txt":"month and a half in, I suppose. I'm like"},{"t":59.4,"txt":"halfway done with course."},{"t":61,"txt":"Um with this, you get pretty much a"},{"t":64.1,"txt":"little bit of everything. So, when I"},{"t":65.8,"txt":"leave here, I can go off and get a job"},{"t":68,"txt":"pretty much with anything. If they have"},{"t":69.8,"txt":"like specifications, then they'll give"},{"t":72.2,"txt":"me tests to take for their"},{"t":73.7,"txt":"specifications. So."},{"t":76.2,"txt":"For work, I'm not really sure at this"},{"t":78.4,"txt":"point. I just know I want to incorporate"},{"t":80,"txt":"welding into something."},{"t":82,"txt":"Um I thought about getting a job where I"},{"t":84.9,"txt":"can travel, cuz I really want to travel"},{"t":86.8,"txt":"and see. But, if not, I would want to"},{"t":89.3,"txt":"get into like repair shops, so I can"},{"t":91.2,"txt":"learn a little bit about different"},{"t":92.4,"txt":"aspects of other things as well."},{"t":98.5,"txt":"Um it can be intimidating as a female to"},{"t":101,"txt":"be in welding, but like anyone, if"},{"t":104,"txt":"you're good at it,"},{"t":105.8,"txt":"you're"},{"t":106.9,"txt":"can thrive. Um I don't look at the whole"},{"t":109.7,"txt":"male-female thing. I think if you can do"},{"t":112.7,"txt":"the job, you should do the job. I would"},{"t":115.4,"txt":"recommend welding as a career cuz there"},{"t":118,"txt":"is such a need for them. You there you"},{"t":120.7,"txt":"go into it and you wouldn't be without a"},{"t":122.3,"txt":"job. It's really interesting and fun,"},{"t":125.5,"txt":"and you can basically go into any"},{"t":128,"txt":"industry with it. You can take"},{"t":130.7,"txt":"a little bit of nothing and turn it into"},{"t":132.2,"txt":"something miraculous. Like our big"},{"t":135.2,"txt":"infrastructures,"},{"t":136.8,"txt":"um arts,"},{"t":138.4,"txt":"um even the chairs we're sitting on,"},{"t":140.3,"txt":"like you can incorporate into everything"},{"t":142.2,"txt":"and I just think it's really cool. You"},{"t":143.9,"txt":"can just make anything."}],"words":[{"t":16.76,"w":"I'm"},{"t":17,"w":"Sydney"},{"t":17.32,"w":"Bray."},{"t":17.92,"w":"I"},{"t":18.2,"w":"am"},{"t":18.6,"w":"a"},{"t":18.68,"w":"welding"},{"t":19,"w":"student"},{"t":19.28,"w":"at"},{"t":19.36,"w":"Linus"},{"t":19.64,"w":"Welding"},{"t":19.92,"w":"and"},{"t":20.04,"w":"Training."},{"t":20.92,"w":"I"},{"t":21.44,"w":"came"},{"t":21.68,"w":"here"},{"t":21.84,"w":"for"},{"t":21.96,"w":"the"},{"t":22.08,"w":"12-week"},{"t":22.64,"w":"combination"},{"t":23.2,"w":"course,"},{"t":23.52,"w":"which"},{"t":23.72,"w":"gets"},{"t":23.96,"w":"a"},{"t":24,"w":"little"},{"t":24.2,"w":"bit"},{"t":24.36,"w":"of"},{"t":24.76,"w":"pipe"},{"t":25.04,"w":"welding,"},{"t":25.84,"w":"aluminum"},{"t":26.16,"w":"structural,"},{"t":26.8,"w":"and"},{"t":26.92,"w":"then"},{"t":27.04,"w":"a"},{"t":27.08,"w":"little"},{"t":27.24,"w":"bit"},{"t":27.36,"w":"of"},{"t":27.44,"w":"MIG"},{"t":27.6,"w":"welding"},{"t":27.88,"w":"as"},{